module jev_calibration_decision_routing_reverse_observation

input expected_route
input observed_source_version
input observed_contract_version
input observed_status
input observed_decision_digest

status BOUND only for exact source, contract, status, and digest
status DEFERRED when the route producer remains deferred
status UNKNOWN for missing, changed, or unresolved evidence

field observation_digest

constraint preserve_identity
constraint preserve_decision_digest
constraint unresolved_is_not_bound
constraint read_only
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization